games-engine.zip

# ============================================================================
# 2026-06-17 3-way-split: re-anchor rules that the pre-split layout rooted at the
# crypto dir. After the split, crypto/ games/ harness/ are siblings under the repo
# root, so root-anchored rules above (data/, runs/, backups/) no longer match the
# real crypto/... paths. These three were clear non-source noise / scratch.
# ============================================================================
(tmp)/
ml_systems_v1/crypto/backups/
ml_systems_v1/crypto/runs/autonomy/
ml_systems_v1/crypto/runs/strat/ladder/*_log.txt
